# Everything under testdata/ is exact bytes. A delta encodes its sizes as
# decimal digits terminated by a newline, and golden.txt is compared byte for
# byte, so a checkout that rewrites LF to CRLF makes them unparseable. Four of
# the five Fossil vectors failed this way on Windows; the fifth survived only
# because it happens to contain a byte that made Git treat it as binary
# already.
testdata/** -text
